diff --git a/.upgradenotes/MDL-89768-2026102412000000.yml b/.upgradenotes/MDL-89768-2026102412000000.yml
new file mode 100644
index 00000000000..a1379ee10e3
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.upgradenotes/MDL-89768-2026102412000000.yml
@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+issueNumber: MDL-89768
+notes:
+  mod_wiki:
+    - message: >-
+        The external functions `mod_wiki_get_subwikis`, `mod_wiki_get_subwiki_pages`
+        and `mod_wiki_get_page_contents` now include the optional `cancreatepages`
+        field in their responses, indicating whether the current user can create
+        new pages in the subwiki (requires both `mod/wiki:editpage` and
+        `mod/wiki:createpage`).
+      type: changed
+    - message: >-
+        The external function `mod_wiki_new_page` now enforces the
+        `mod/wiki:createpage` capability and throws a `nocreatepermission`
+        exception when the user does not have it.
+      type: changed
